    <briefdescription>
<para>Composable utility-stage lifecycle manager. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stages are registered in order; <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_i_utils_pipeline_1a0b7f975d7f4ccd1236857638c9db89c5" kindref="member">run()</ref> executes them sequentially. <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_i_utils_pipeline_1aaa60dead0702b55c6778f322aa6779dc" kindref="member">shutdown()</ref> tears down all registered stages in reverse registration order. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
